/*!

*\page rem  Rem
*
* After REM instruction, all letters to the end of the line or to the position of finding a semicolon will be ignored<BR>
*<span style='color:blue'><em><B> <br> Note:</B> </em> </span><br>
*Although rem line is not executed and doesn't affect the execution of the script program, but it will occupies the memory space. It is not recommended to use REM a lot. 
*<span style='color:blue'><em><H4> Syntax: </H4></em></span>
*<B> rem comments ;  </B>
*<BR><B> comments: </B> Optional. The text of any comment you want to include. A space is required between the "rem" -keyword and the comments. <br>
<span style='color:blue'><em><B> <br>
Example:
</B> </em> </span><br>
<span style='color:green'> rem Sample script program 2018-06-04 </span><br>
*/
